  "_note": "RouteGuard design tokens, Round 2. The palette is taken from NH-44 itself: highway-sign green (brand.highway), the yellow cap of National Highway milestones (brand.milestone), Kashmir apple red (brand.apple) and Indian Railways blue (brand.rail), on concrete and asphalt neutrals. The *.ink tokens are darker versions for text, added because the base colour failed WCAG for that use (see contrast_pairs and rejected_pairs). One source of truth: the style guide, the prototype, the Figma plugin and scripts/verify_round2_all.py all read or are checked against this file.",
